WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.900
Running a dive center is
the best job in the world.

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:05.140
The paperwork?

00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:06.450
Not so much.

00:00:07.467 --> 00:00:11.987
Meet Scubook, the all-in-one
CRM, built by a Dive Center,

00:00:12.027 --> 00:00:13.587
for Dive Centers.

00:00:13.627 --> 00:00:17.427
Bookings, check-ins, boats,
payments and your team,

00:00:17.467 --> 00:00:19.027
all in one place.

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:22.537
Let's go through it, in the
order you'll really use it.

00:00:24.433 --> 00:00:26.473
Every dive center is different.

00:00:26.513 --> 00:00:29.833
Different boats, different
pools, different times.

00:00:29.873 --> 00:00:33.353
So the first thing Scubook
does is adapt to yours.

00:00:33.393 --> 00:00:36.313
You start with your name,
your dive center's name,

00:00:36.353 --> 00:00:39.993
Blue Reef Divers here,
your logo and your colors.

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:42.393
No installation, no card.

00:00:42.433 --> 00:00:45.273
Then open Settings, and Trips.

00:00:45.313 --> 00:00:46.473
Add your boats.

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:49.703
Here, two: the first one becomes Manta,

00:00:49.743 --> 00:00:51.113
with twelve places.

00:00:51.153 --> 00:00:53.753
The second, Dolphin, with ten.

00:00:53.793 --> 00:00:57.113
Same for your pool:
Training pool, eight places.

00:00:57.153 --> 00:00:59.113
Your dive sites are already listed,

00:00:59.153 --> 00:01:00.633
and you can add your own.

00:01:00.673 --> 00:01:04.393
Your departure times too:
rename them to match your day.

00:01:04.433 --> 00:01:06.873
Now, watch how flexible it is.

00:01:06.913 --> 00:01:09.883
A Discovery Scuba Dive:
at nine in the morning,

00:01:09.923 --> 00:01:11.273
in the training pool.

00:01:11.313 --> 00:01:14.633
Then, in the afternoon, at sea on Manta.

00:01:14.673 --> 00:01:18.713
One booking, two parts of the
day, exactly how you run it.

00:01:18.753 --> 00:01:22.863
Ten minutes, and Scubook
looks like your dive center.

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:28.640
Paper forms get lost,
handwriting is hard to read,

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:31.440
and someone has to type everything again.

00:01:31.480 --> 00:01:35.470
With Scubook, your guest scans
the QR code on your counter.

00:01:35.510 --> 00:01:37.920
Your own check-in form opens on her phone,

00:01:37.960 --> 00:01:39.440
in your colors.

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:43.040
She enters her name, her email,
and her WhatsApp number with the

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:46.110
country code, so your
messages always arrive.

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:48.640
Her nationality, her certification level,

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:50.400
her emergency contact.

00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:55.120
Her equipment sizes: wetsuit,
BCD, fins and weights.

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:56.960
And how she heard about you.

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:59.520
She accepts the consent, taps send,

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:00.720
and she's done.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.920
Back on your home screen,
Sophia is already waiting,

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:05.520
in the check-ins to book.

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:07.920
Open her file: everything is there,

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.360
nothing to retype.

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:11.760
Add her course, choose her instructor,

00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:12.600
save.

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:13.520
Booked.

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:18.790
No paper, no typing, no mistakes,
and a booking ready in seconds.

00:02:20.900 --> 00:02:24.670
Every morning, the same
questions: who's on which boat,

00:02:24.710 --> 00:02:25.820
and with whom?

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:27.180
Open Schedule.

00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:30.030
Who goes where: each boat and the pool,

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:32.780
with the places taken and the places left.

00:02:32.820 --> 00:02:35.900
Manta, four out of twelve, at Manta Ridge,

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:38.380
with Kadek, Maya and Lena.

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:40.970
Tap a boat to choose its dive site.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:45.100
Below, your day by instructor,
each one with their own customers.

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:46.780
Only want Lena's divers?

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:47.930
One filter.

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:49.180
And see these flags?

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:52.060
They show the languages
each instructor speaks.

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.230
A German diver?

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.620
Lena speaks German.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:59.250
Your whole day on one screen,
and everyone knows where to be.

00:03:01.367 --> 00:03:04.447
Now, the part that
saves you the most time.

00:03:04.487 --> 00:03:07.377
Fitting gear is where mornings disappear:

00:03:07.417 --> 00:03:11.837
trying wetsuits, swapping fins,
looking for the right BCD.

00:03:11.877 --> 00:03:14.367
Remember the sizes your
guests gave at check-in?

00:03:14.407 --> 00:03:16.847
They're right here, on every booking:

00:03:16.887 --> 00:03:20.927
BCD M, wetsuit S, fins 39.

00:03:20.967 --> 00:03:23.117
Your instructors see them the day before,

00:03:23.157 --> 00:03:26.527
and prepare each kit before
the guest even arrives.

00:03:26.567 --> 00:03:29.967
Less time on equipment,
more time with your divers.

00:03:30.007 --> 00:03:32.037
Every single morning.

00:03:34.233 --> 00:03:38.593
Partial payments, cash,
cards, and marine fees on top:

00:03:38.633 --> 00:03:40.513
it's easy to lose track.

00:03:40.553 --> 00:03:43.193
Payments shows every open balance.

00:03:43.233 --> 00:03:46.033
Pick one, choose the
method, enter the amount,

00:03:46.073 --> 00:03:48.753
and your takings update
on the home screen.

00:03:48.793 --> 00:03:52.113
Marine fees have their own tab,
so they never get mixed with your

00:03:52.153 --> 00:03:53.023
revenue.

00:03:53.063 --> 00:03:56.353
And your prices are yours: edit any price,

00:03:56.393 --> 00:03:59.953
create packages, like
three, five or ten dives,

00:03:59.993 --> 00:04:02.113
or give a discount on a booking.

00:04:02.153 --> 00:04:05.633
Nobody leaves without paying, and
you always know what's left to

00:04:05.673 --> 00:04:06.743
collect.

00:04:08.967 --> 00:04:12.527
Instagram, Google, a hotel, a friend:

00:04:12.567 --> 00:04:15.207
where do your customers really come from?

00:04:15.247 --> 00:04:17.487
Remember the question
on the check-in form:

00:04:17.527 --> 00:04:19.247
how did you hear about us?

00:04:19.287 --> 00:04:21.247
Scubook adds it all up.

00:04:21.287 --> 00:04:25.727
For each source: new customers,
bookings and revenue.

00:04:25.767 --> 00:04:27.917
Here, Instagram brings the most.

00:04:27.957 --> 00:04:30.717
You even choose the answers, in Settings.

00:04:30.757 --> 00:04:34.837
So you know exactly where to
spend your time and your money.

00:04:36.967 --> 00:04:40.607
Work messages get lost in
personal WhatsApp groups.

00:04:40.647 --> 00:04:43.087
Scubook has its own team chat.

00:04:43.127 --> 00:04:46.607
Write to the whole team at
once, share a photo or a file,

00:04:46.647 --> 00:04:48.847
and get a notification on your phone.

00:04:48.887 --> 00:04:52.437
Your team talks in the same
place as your bookings.

00:04:54.567 --> 00:04:56.847
How many tanks are really ready?

00:04:56.887 --> 00:04:58.527
Who counted the wetsuits?

00:04:58.567 --> 00:05:02.127
In Inventory, each type
of gear has its own icon,

00:05:02.167 --> 00:05:03.727
and you can add your own.

00:05:03.767 --> 00:05:06.847
Tap plus or minus to update a count.

00:05:06.887 --> 00:05:09.327
Scubook remembers who checked each item,

00:05:09.367 --> 00:05:12.927
and when, and the activity
list shows every change.

00:05:12.967 --> 00:05:16.837
You always know what you
have, and who checked it last.

00:05:18.967 --> 00:05:22.247
Medical certificates,
insurance, boat papers:

00:05:22.287 --> 00:05:24.207
they're never where you need them.

00:05:24.247 --> 00:05:26.767
In Documents, your folders are ready,

00:05:26.807 --> 00:05:28.607
each with its own emoji.

00:05:28.647 --> 00:05:32.927
Open Medical, add a file, or
simply take a photo of the paper.

00:05:32.967 --> 00:05:37.007
Add an expiry date, and Scubook
warns you a month before.

00:05:37.047 --> 00:05:42.097
Open it, download it, print it,
or send it on WhatsApp in one tap.

00:05:42.137 --> 00:05:45.567
Every important paper, for
your dives and for your team,

00:05:45.607 --> 00:05:47.637
found in seconds.

00:05:49.767 --> 00:05:52.767
No two instructors are paid the same way.

00:05:52.807 --> 00:05:55.437
Add a member: their name, their role,

00:05:55.477 --> 00:05:58.207
and their flags, the languages they speak.

00:05:58.247 --> 00:06:00.207
Then, how they're paid.

00:06:00.247 --> 00:06:02.527
Most of your team can share a pool.

00:06:02.567 --> 00:06:06.527
Sam is freelance: commission
only, never in the pool.

00:06:06.567 --> 00:06:09.327
You can even set a custom
rate for one person,

00:06:09.367 --> 00:06:11.327
and their days off per month.

00:06:11.367 --> 00:06:14.117
Your rules, person by person.

00:06:16.233 --> 00:06:17.713
Pay is private.

00:06:17.753 --> 00:06:20.913
The Commission tab is locked
with your own password:

00:06:20.953 --> 00:06:23.443
only the people who know it can open it.

00:06:23.483 --> 00:06:27.473
And in Settings, you choose
which roles can even see the tab.

00:06:27.513 --> 00:06:31.873
Inside, Scubook calculates everything
from the activities your instructors

00:06:31.913 --> 00:06:34.353
really did, as individual commissions,

00:06:34.393 --> 00:06:36.113
or as a shared pool.

00:06:36.153 --> 00:06:40.903
Private, automatic, and no more
calculator at the end of the month.

00:06:43.033 --> 00:06:46.233
In a shared pool, fair
means: the more you work,

00:06:46.273 --> 00:06:47.713
the more you earn.

00:06:47.753 --> 00:06:51.473
In Leave, set how many
days off each person gets.

00:06:51.513 --> 00:06:52.993
Here, six per month.

00:06:53.033 --> 00:06:56.993
Mark the days yourself, or let your
instructors ask from their phone:

00:06:57.033 --> 00:07:00.083
orange while it waits,
green once you accept.

00:07:00.123 --> 00:07:02.563
And the pool follows, automatically.

00:07:02.603 --> 00:07:06.143
Kadek took three days off:
he worked twenty-one days,

00:07:06.183 --> 00:07:08.593
and gets twenty-four point one percent.

00:07:08.633 --> 00:07:12.993
Tomás took six: eighteen days,
twenty point seven percent.

00:07:13.033 --> 00:07:17.793
Lena and Maya worked every day:
twenty-seven point six percent each.

00:07:17.833 --> 00:07:21.463
Fair pay, calculated for you, every month.

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:26.520
Your dive center changes: a new boat,

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:29.000
new prices, new people.

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:32.040
Everything lives in
Settings, sorted by topic:

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:35.320
your center, trips, bookings, money,

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:37.240
marketing and team.

00:07:37.280 --> 00:07:39.880
Change a color, a trip time, a fee,

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:44.360
or who sees what, and it's saved
for the whole team instantly.

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:48.350
Scubook adapts to you,
not the other way around.

00:07:49.567 --> 00:07:50.487
Scubook.

00:07:50.527 --> 00:07:52.767
Less admin, more diving.

00:07:52.807 --> 00:07:55.927
Try the free 24-hour demo, no card needed,

00:07:55.967 --> 00:07:58.167
at scubook.app
